": "The order request timed out, so it may or may not have gone through. I'll check the order list before retrying so I don't create a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01L9c4jSPofdptAaFyGX3qUg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_orders", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The timeout left a partial order behind: PO0001 contains the 3 DK-200 docks ($567) but not the MN-27 monitors, and its status is \"partially_placed\". Re-running the full order would duplicate the docks, and I can't add lines to an existing order. I'll cancel this partial order so the complete order can be placed as one purchase order.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01N3mJGeJQebn7gWLMaaNWch", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"order_id": "PO0001"}, "name": "cancel_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014zhqh8hGd1nYuozWyDqSKE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_orders", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012LC1mZMhxPH69A7t2JjQmc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "newhire-dock-monitor-HQ-2024-DK200-MN27-x3-v2"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WmyyXjG1s4RpkcD6Xr5evB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_orders", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The order is placed as a single purchase order, PO0002, shipping to HQ. It contains:\n\n- 3 \u00d7 USB-C Dock DK-200 (new, not refurbished): $567\n- 3 \u00d7 27-inch 4K Monitor MN-27 (new, not refurbished): $987\n- **Total: $1,554**\